# PAM configuration file for SqWebMail daemon (Courier-PCP)
#
# This file configures Pluggable Authentication Modules (PAM) for the
# SqWebMail daemon, which is part of the Courier Mail Server suite.
# It defines the authentication stack for web-based mail access.

# Account management: check if the account is valid and not locked.
# Includes standard account checks (password expiry, account status).
@include common-account

# Authentication: perform user verification against system credentials (PAM).
# Includes standard auth steps (e.g., unix_chkpwd, pam_securetty).
@include common-auth

# Password management: update user password if required.
# Includes standard password change policies.
@include common-password
